    "be50793b-f8d4-4246-9c53-f7d93753bb8c": {
      "type": "accordion-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16030540595388__be50793b-f8d4-4246-9c53-f7d93753bb8c-1687845164ed36f9e6-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Xendurance and its mission?",
            "content": "<p>Founded over 25 years ago, Xendurance set out to revolutionize sports nutrition and wellness with a commitment to exceptional performance and uncompromising product quality. In 2008, it became <strong>the first company to achieve Informed Sport certification</strong> for its flagship product, Extreme Endurance, marking a milestone in its pursuit of excellence. </p><p>Driven by the founders’ extensive experience as athletes and health professionals, Xendurance continues to empower athletes and active individuals of all ages through innovation, integrity, and a relentless focus on optimal performance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16030540595388__be50793b-f8d4-4246-9c53-f7d93753bb8c-1687845164ed36f9e6-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long has Xendurance been in business?",
            "content": "<p>Going strong since 1998!</p>"
          }
        },
        "93b9e4fb-6fce-4cd6-888e-86f15fc9a7ee": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "What sets Xendurance apart from other supplement brands?",
            "content": "<p>Write content to help your customers to better understand your products or policies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "4c9819f1-8eb5-405c-9abc-6ff4fc054ef0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Xendurance products tested for quality and safety?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Xendurance products are proudly manufactured in the US using US and globally sourced ingredients in GMP certified manufacturing facilities. </p><p>Xendurance was the <strong>first US sports nutrition company </strong>to use Informed Sport, starting in 2008 with our product, Extreme Endurance.</p><p>Many of the Xendurance products are tested by Informed Sport to guarantee \"safe for sport\".*</p>"
          }
        }
      },
