    "3ccf898c-e0e6-4510-a68d-baaf06439ebb": {
      "type": "accordion-content",
      "blocks": {
        "7ac82b1d-1c6f-4574-af69-d3fc200c2957": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Xendurance 60-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</strong></p><p>At Xendurance, we stand behind the quality of our products. That’s why we offer a <strong>100% money-back guarantee</strong> within <strong>60 days</strong> of purchase. If you are not completely satisfied, you may request a return or an exchange.</p><p>To initiate a return or exchange, please contact us at <strong>info@xendurance.com</strong> with your order details. You may request a return or an exchange by mailing your product—<strong>opened, unused, or partial</strong>—back to:</p><p><strong>Xendurance<br/>8465 N 90th St. Suites 6-7 <br/>Scottsdale, AZ 85258</strong></p><p>Please note that <strong>we do not provide return shipping labels</strong>, and customers are responsible for return shipping costs. Our team will guide you through the process to ensure a smooth experience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "7ec304d7-7dd0-49cd-9c3e-2feb280d7e8a": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Damaged or Faulty Products",
            "content": "<p>In the rare case that you have received a damaged product, please reach out to info@xendurance.com and we will help resolve the issue.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c01be31b-62f3-4ff0-a7b1-155f78a05eb5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I initiate a return or exchange?",
            "content": "<p>Please contact us at info@xendurance.com with your order number, and our team will promptly assist in resolving the issue.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
